{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_13_level_st_13-01","groupId":"main_13","stageId":"st_13-01","title":"戰場內外","storyCode":"13-1","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_13-01.txt","sourceHash":"14e768ff6f09ef0348d3241df245273dc3d506f10fd42954b94be308a19d2b58","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"維多利亞國立大學古典學系資深教授塞繆爾·瑟斯曾經把卡薩根爵士豐厚的藏書比作倫蒂尼姆郊外的冬青林。\n\\n這些知識的結晶，這些歷史的投影，我們行過之路與我們將行之路皆可在這裡找到對應。\n\\n史詩與哲思被記錄，神話與理論一一歸檔，謙卑的學者們用智慧與勤奮把這裡塗滿，每位桂冠詩人都擁有只屬於自己的書架。\n\\n“風暴終會消散，希望也不會真正磨滅。這些被記述下的東西所構成的，就是我們驕傲的文明本身。”\n卡薩根爵士是個不錯的獄友，我們隔著一堵牆爭論過很多問題，也許正因為那堵牆，他直到最後也沒發現我是個薩卡茲，他只當我是個太溺於反思的維多利亞人。\n\\n我仍記得他被從我隔壁牢房帶離之前，最後說的話。\n“在任何困難的年月，只要一位自豪的維多利亞人回到那裡，就能重新感受到嚴冬不長，春天將近。”\n\\n“……朋友，只要回到那裡。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g5_noblehall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睏倦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"毫無辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睏倦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我試過，那幾本書就連裡面的紙都是皮做的，根本點不著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飢餓的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"如果紙是皮做的，為什麼還叫紙，而不直接叫皮呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睏倦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睏倦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"*薩卡茲粗口*，這火根本就不旺，到處都是煙，可鍋裡的湯完全沒動靜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飢餓的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"“湯”……這東西就是清水裡漂了點菜梗和肉片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睏倦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"說到底都是他們的問題！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睏倦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"那些不正眼看人的王庭混蛋讓我們幹這些髒活累活，滿城抓倫蒂尼姆人，把他們塞進工廠做工，卻連碗熱湯都不捨得給我們準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飢餓的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長說，我們現在正式佔領倫蒂尼姆啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飢餓的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"城防軍被解散了，那個叫萊托的黎博利失了業。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睏倦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我開始後悔沒跟W那個瘋女人走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睏倦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"算了……跟她走也未必有什麼好下場。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飢餓的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"這些，還有那些……都是什麼書？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睏倦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"沒興趣，說不定是折扣目錄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飢餓的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼那個老菲林要收集這麼多折扣目錄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睏倦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼這麼多問題。誰在乎維多利亞人在想什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睏倦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，我從沒見過一個上了年紀的人哭成那樣，你剛才看到了嗎？他的繡花衣襟都被鼻涕黏在一起了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飢餓的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睏倦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，傻愣著幹嘛！去多給我拿幾本過來，火又要滅了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睏倦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你在幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飢餓的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……看書。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睏倦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"啥，“看”？你就不認字！這些還都是維多利亞字！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飢餓的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"除了字，書裡還有畫呢！你看這些插圖，這個菲林女的給了這男人一巴掌，他們倆什麼關係？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睏倦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜是姘頭。有沒有點更帶勁的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飢餓的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"沒了，剩下的圖都很無聊……這些東西光一本就有足足幾百頁，這裡有多少本？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飢餓的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊還有些比較薄的，那裡面每行寫不了幾個字就要轉向下一行……到底維多利亞人在裡面寫了些什麼東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飢餓的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"這片大地上真的有那麼多值得被寫成書的東西嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飢餓的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"這本，這本，還有那本……還用這麼好的玻璃櫃，還分了這麼多類別？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睏倦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"還有一種可能，維多利亞人有錢到願意把廁紙都釘在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飢餓的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，說不定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飢餓的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"我們為什麼沒有自己的書？這些被翻得捲了邊的玩意……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睏倦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"搞不好真的有呢，聽說巫妖不就是一群把自己關在圖書館裡的神經病。關了很多很多年，從不露面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睏倦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我一點也不關心。有熱湯喝最重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飢餓的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，每天都沒什麼差別，每本也都沒什麼差別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飢餓的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"就算我不認字，我也知道，從來就沒什麼新鮮事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飢餓的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"一千年前，我們用刀殺人，現在，我們有了些效率更高的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飢餓的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"也許再過一千年，我們可以飄在天上，用……我不知道，雲和星星？繼續殺來殺去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睏倦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你說，要是我們能在月亮上建房子，種地吃飯，以後是不是就不用這麼打了？或者什麼更大的事發生，大家就不想著打仗了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飢餓的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睏倦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"……唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睏倦的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"（呵欠）算了，該燒下一本了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"有時我會想，我所做的這些工作，不過是在滿足自己，不過是試圖證明自己仍是個“清醒”的人。\n\\n伊內絲說得對，這除了讓我睡不著覺，沒什麼別的作用。\n畢竟，卡茲戴爾可能都找不出幾個會用印刷機的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅酒報資深編輯","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"你得盡快上手，小子，報社不是學校，我沒義務教你怎麼辦事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅酒報資深編輯","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"或者滾回鄉下去。你的實習期還有幾個月？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅酒報實習記者","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我很抱歉，先生，我只是……想要寫得嚴謹點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅酒報資深編輯","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"“嚴謹”？我要的不是天災學論文，我要的是我們在集團內的發行量永遠壓《四城競技報》一頭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅酒報資深編輯","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你是個路過報亭的上班族，或者城際網路的新聞訂閱戶，你會為了一篇叫“維多利亞在天災學方面取得重大進展”的文章付錢嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅酒報實習記者","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，“薩卡茲毀滅維多利亞！”這標題，是不是有些……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅酒報資深編輯","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為我們的讀者想要的是真相？就連《中央新聞報》的那些精英訂閱戶們要的也不是“真相”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅酒報資深編輯","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"你該餵給他們的是焦慮，是恐懼，是優越感，是有所指向的情緒和結論，然後他們才會想要更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅酒報資深編輯","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"然後我們才能從他們的口袋裡掏出錢來，你也才能保住自己的這份工作。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅酒報資深編輯","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"誰啊，這個時候還——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅酒報資深編輯","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅酒報資深編輯","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"……新來的，送版樣的車走了多久了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅酒報實習記者","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"半個小時，難、難道是維多利亞那邊又來了新消息？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅酒報資深編輯","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，蠢貨，馬上跟我去印刷廠，他們應該還沒下版，現在還追得上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅酒報資深編輯","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"我去給總編打電話，你馬上給我寫一篇新的頭版頭條出來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅酒報實習記者","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"關於什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅酒報資深編輯","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"我的線人說，那個散華騎士團的薇薇安娜，消失了好久的燭騎士，明天會正式宣布退役！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅酒報資深編輯","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"快點，我們必須是全卡西米爾第一家報導這事的媒體！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅酒報資深編輯","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"該向商業聯合會證明哪裡才是玫瑰報業最重要的編輯部了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅酒報實習記者","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"那維多利亞和碎片大廈的事情……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅酒報資深編輯","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"沒人在乎了，小子，泰拉每天發生那麼多事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅酒報資深編輯","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"記住，我們只需要抓住最有意義的那些而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅酒報資深編輯","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"快點叫車！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅酒報實習記者","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅酒報實習記者","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，先生，放在以前，這附近總有些魔族佬黑車司機……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅酒報實習記者","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"最近是不是很少看見他們了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"薩卡茲的歷史就是戰爭史本身，這是一項可悲的事實，我忠於它。\n\\n但我仍試圖向他們證明，發生在我們身上的這些事情，除了殺戮之外，仍有東西值得被銘記，值得被思考。\n\\n這片大地上，有機會被鄭重寫下的事情本就屈指可數。\n\\n可是，就算我記錄下這些往事……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_srgmarket"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商隊頭領","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"這和我們說好的不一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑市商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"沒貨就是沒貨，透娜。眼下的情況就是這樣，所有的源石炸藥都賣光了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商隊頭領","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"我訂的武器呢？那座礦洞裡塞滿了源石蟲和巨型鉗獸，還有天知道什麼別的怪物，你指望我們徒手解決它們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑市商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"這是你要處理的問題，我管不了。告訴你吧，最近大半個月，你跑遍整個黑市，都搞不到哪怕半打武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商隊頭領","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"哪家傭兵隊能把全部東西都吃下來？他們瘋了？就算是太陽谷工業也不可能買下那麼多——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商隊頭領","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"……是王酋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商隊頭領","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"又是哪個倒霉蛋王酋要挨宰了，透露一點，我們好繞著走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑市商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是王酋。他們很神秘，我不好說……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑市商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）可能是……帕夏。而且，不止一位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑市商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商隊頭領","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"你在胡說什麼？帕夏會來黑市掃貨？還不止一位？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商隊頭領","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"這不可能，他們有自己的管道，而且……不止一位帕夏，大規模收購武器？你知道這意味著什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑市商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"我也就是隨便猜猜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑市商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"他們用了好幾層中間人，還借了外國公司當白手套，每次收購的量也恰好在不引起懷疑的程度，要說只是巧合，也說得通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑市商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，在薩爾貢，誰能這麼完美地包攬這一切？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商隊頭領","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，老闆。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要的車子和補給搞定了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑市商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，四輛車、口糧、水、帳篷，都已經準備好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，錢在這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商隊頭領","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"“膠條”什麼時候這麼有錢了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑市商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我聽說他和他的那隊僱傭兵不打算繼續在薩爾貢待著了，他們拿出了所有的錢，要去別的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑市商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"哥倫比亞吧，或者維多利亞？最近轉行的魔族僱傭兵好像格外地多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商隊頭領","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"他們想幹嘛？“膠條”那小子不是全家都在薩爾貢嗎？他不管他那斷了腿的老爸了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑市商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"誰知道，我向來搞不清這幫魔族佬在想什麼。可能只是看膩了沙子和雨林，想換個生活環境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商隊頭領","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"……但願吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商隊頭領","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"我總覺得……好多事情比以前複雜了不知道多少倍，我通通都搞不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商隊頭領","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"——該死，我爺爺那一輩好像只用考慮哪裡的小角跳獸最蠢，比較適合當作全家的晚飯，他們那時候是不是沒這麼多破事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑市商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"也可能只是我們這些生活在薩爾貢鄉下的人都能感覺到“它”衝過來了而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商隊頭領","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"“它”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑市商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"就像小角跳獸，它急起來，也能撞得你四仰八叉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"就算我記述下這些，記述下我們的方言、我們的食譜。\n\\n記述下農婦的一首詩，運輸隊長酒醉後的大話；記述下戰壕裡的愛情，廢墟裡的塗鴉……\n這些東西，在痛苦面前，仍舊不值一提。\n\\n它們甚至成了某種嘲諷，它們似乎在告訴我的讀者（如果有的話），我們該用暴力奪回這些。\n這不是我的本意，可我……也無權為他們提供結論。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g1_victoriavillage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"那信使該來了，他是在路上又被哪位漂亮小姐勾了魂去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經受夠了他那些遲到的藉口了，就沒人能給他點教訓，讓他知道自己的工作很重要嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴著禮帽的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他不會來了，郵政信使亞瑟·莫里森死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"死了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴著禮帽的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他因叛國罪而被處決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"叛、叛國？你……是什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴著禮帽的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"配合我的工作，我們彼此都更省事。請你和我談談這位亞瑟·莫里森。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我們完全不熟悉，只是因為他是附近唯一一個會跑倫蒂尼姆的郵政信使，我女兒又在倫蒂尼姆上大學，我們才偶爾打一點交道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"他居然叛國了……他投靠了薩卡茲？我女兒在信裡和我說過，倫蒂尼姆現在到處都是薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"那小混蛋，我早就知道他不是好人！居然和魔族佬勾搭在一起，他活該！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴著禮帽的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴著禮帽的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們確信，亞瑟·莫里森為烏薩斯服務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯？可，可是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴著禮帽的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你，是他的同事，威斯里·羅特先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"什——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈哈，大人，您在說什麼笑話，我是個土生土長的菲林，在這裡種了一輩子馬鈴薯，連烏薩斯話都不會說！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"您一定是哪裡誤會了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴著禮帽的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"種馬鈴薯可種不出你女兒在維多利亞國立大學的學費。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴著禮帽的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你堅持的話，我可以卸掉你的另一隻胳膊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴著禮帽的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別浪費我的時間，你的所有反抗都沒有意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"……所以，那些傳言是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯人告訴我的是真的！倫蒂尼姆被正式佔領了，這一個月，我沒收到哪怕一條從倫蒂尼姆來的消息，連傳言都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"那些該死的薩卡茲，他們侮辱我們，他們謀殺我們，他們奴役我們！而你們，這些自詡維多利亞保護者的人，你們在幹嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"倫蒂尼姆城裡就沒有你的親戚朋友、父母孩子嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，當然，你是個大人物，你總有辦法為他們安排後路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"只有我們這樣的窮酸鬼，自以為把孩子送去了偉大的倫蒂尼姆，送去了維多利亞的中心，他們將來就一定能成為了不起的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"結果呢？哈哈，哈哈！在我們國家的首都，他們變成了薩卡茲的苦力，薩卡茲的奴隸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"那些魔族佬在用維多利亞的風暴摧毀維多利亞，而你們全部坐視不管！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴著禮帽的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以你淺薄的見識，你無法明白維多利亞的用心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴著禮帽的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你只需要把我帶去你們的情報交接處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴著禮帽的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"咕——呃呃——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑色的長矛從他的身體裡噴湧而出。\n眼前的男人抽搐著伸出雙手，想要拔除破胸的恐懼。\n他的手，在觸達那種邪穢的一瞬間，就已扭曲凋零。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"嘶……\n粗重的呼吸從遠方傳來，讓人脊背生寒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴著禮帽的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴著禮帽的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我。“開夏郡的春花開了。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴著禮帽的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關閉所有通訊，十五分鐘後，如果我沒有主動發起聯絡，馬上放棄這個鎮子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴著禮帽的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……但願我不會溺死在這片花香裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"正是盛夏時節，口鼻中卻會呼出白霧。\n不能畏縮，不能膽怯。他必須以維多利亞的名義和對方建立溝通。\n到底在哪裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"嘶……呼……\n11，29，1。【密語】。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不能回頭。不能看見彼此。希望對方心知肚明地遵守這小小的遊戲規則。\n他能拴住猛獸，可拴不住精怪。\n雪片飛舞，漆黑沾染了維多利亞的土地。\n狹長的陰影自腳下延展。他知道，就在身後。\n有多近？心跳聲像是響雷，黑色的呼吸抓撓著他的脊背，周遭萬籟俱寂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"嘶……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴著禮帽的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（高盧語）我需要一個解釋。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"93。【密語】。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"（高盧語）這次行動未經陛下首肯，任何僭越都不被允許。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"（高盧語）叛國者皆已伏誅，僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴著禮帽的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（高盧語）我明白了。我們不曾見過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴著禮帽的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……他走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潛伏特工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"灰禮帽閣下，我們監控到了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴著禮帽的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們什麼都沒有監控到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴著禮帽的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他能進入這裡，而我們還活著，這本身就是維多利亞和烏薩斯的表態。此事只需直接匯報給公爵閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴著禮帽的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威斯里·羅特畏罪自殺了，任務結束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潛伏特工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看來集團軍和皇帝的意見並不統一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴著禮帽的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們的任何行動都可能會促成這種統一的達成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴著禮帽的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們還沒有打定主意，但那個帝國……恐怕，最終會下定決心的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"是不是，我的這些工作也成了柴薪的一部分，薩卡茲的所有生活，除了被點燃，沒有其他的意義？\n\\n那我為什麼還要記錄，那我為什麼還要書寫？\n\\n我的戰爭史裡除了那一次又一次的毀滅……\n我更想記述下，每個士兵在戰鬥過後，望向卡茲戴爾時所唱的歌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左後方，三輛車，十五人以上。他們跟了我們很久，但……很謹慎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迄今為止，只是跟著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以讓W打方向盤迴轉，說不定他們很樂意跟你問個好，再送你些倫蒂尼姆的紀念品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"紀念品？他們手上捏著的那一大團源石技藝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前挨的那幾下已經夠我受的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些傭兵的行動很奇怪，與其說是在獵殺我們，不如說……是在驅趕我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們希望我們遠離倫蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咱們高高在上的曼弗雷德將軍為了保你的命，還真是煞費苦心啊。你倆真不是拜把兄弟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不如接受他的好意，回卡茲戴爾教貧民窟的小鬼們識字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說到底，是誰把你從軍事委員會的大牢裡放出來的？我撿到你的時候，你可都已經在倫蒂尼姆的城牆外面散步了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的牢房有一段時間無人看守。我原以為是個陷阱，但現在看來，也許更糟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相比於用這麼迂迴的辦法，暗示我去做某些麻煩的事……我倒寧願簡單點，要了我的命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何況，我們還不清楚，這些“麻煩事”到底是什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就躲開它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W，還能再加速嗎，我們該告別這些太過戀戀不捨的送別者們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這輛二手車可經不起折騰，不過好消息是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咱們剛巧進雷區了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"半個鐘頭以前我親自埋的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，坐穩了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看起來就是在從所有的炸彈上面蹚過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我保證，留給他們的更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"轉過前面那片樹林之後停車，接下來我們下車步行。載具的目標太大，他們遲早還會追上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但願你真的記得每一枚地雷究竟埋在哪，W。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真該慶幸，我們都還完整。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣，我確實記得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有幾枚爆炸了的……唔，也許是，那個詞怎麼說的來著？“地質運動”導致的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些人沒跟上來，我們確實應該甩開他們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們需要更多情報，最好盡快和羅德島合流，阿斯卡綸和博士現在都在溫德米爾的軍艦上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些事情，讓我很……不安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看見了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是直覺。看見的越沒問題，我越不安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們都見過了這一位“博士”。現在是羅德島的博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我還不能給你一個直接的結論，但某種意義上，那位博士確實變得“軟弱”了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的軟弱並不是一個貶義詞。但也許我們現在不那麼需要一個“軟弱的博士”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，你確定？誰知道會不會有羅德島幹員突然回憶起切爾諾伯格的什麼事，在背後捅我刀子呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的有你嘴上表現的這麼懷疑嗎，W？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難講。有個老女人不怎麼讓我接近他們敬愛的“博士”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在這片戰場裡行走了這麼久，有什麼想法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哈哈。我不過是像蟲子一樣被趕來趕去，組織不了任何像樣的軍事行動，只能近距離觀賞現代社會最神奇的一場圍城戰……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哈。哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"混亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有時甚至會琢磨，現在這個時候，這場仗真的還有人在指揮嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"王庭的各個軍團之間根本沒什麼配合可言。更別說那些從各個地方趕來維多利亞的，滿懷著復仇理想的雜牌士兵們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但幕後黑手是特雷西斯。所以，這只可能是被精心設計的混亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他現在根本沒考慮什麼戰略上的亂七八糟的事，他只是……搭好了舞台。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——然後等待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於等待的是什麼……我不想去猜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不能腦袋空空地去見博士和凱爾希醫生，然後指望他們給我們下達什麼指令。在巴別塔，我們已經吃過苦頭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"必須掌握主動權，有一個……也許以我們的身份接觸起來更方便的訊息來源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼身份？可憐蟲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多吧。薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，以防萬一——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們有沒有聽說過任何一種，能殺死巫妖的方法？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
